AVIF encoder used by Imgkeep's "Save as AVIF" (since 0.10.0). The only compiled code in Imgkeep.

Files, unchanged from the npm package @jsquash/avif version 2.1.1 (folder codec/enc):
  avif_enc.js    Emscripten loader (generic: it also mentions fetch, XMLHttpRequest and importScripts for
                 other environments; in Imgkeep they never run, because offscreen.js hands it the .wasm bytes)
  avif_enc.wasm  libavif 1.0.1 with the libaom AV1 encoder, compiled to WebAssembly

sha256:
  c6805e62cae5c1b9870fcc0448437da9e4edfc58c3da264af52361281082c63c  avif_enc.js
  d9f2a95164362af48558d176e619becfd49dd97b50b86c679b47100860522b3d  avif_enc.wasm

Check it yourself:  npm pack @jsquash/avif@2.1.1, unpack it, and compare package/codec/enc/ with these files
(shasum -a 256). tests/static-check.mjs fails the build if either file changes.

